  "description": "4 Stocks I Just Bought From The Long Term StockTok Screener",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to <strong>StockTok</strong></em>! This is just a quick note of 4 stocks that I am picking up from the long term investing screener. None of these positions are particularly large, as the screener is new. But I felt it would be good to put my money where my mouth is…plus, ill certainly be tracking them if I watch it day to day. The short term screener produces 75% accuracy over a 24 hour period, 81% over a rolling time frame. My suspicion is that the longer term screener will actually have a higher accuracy rating, but be slower moving…again, that is a hypothesis. We will know in time. </p><p>Again…no stop recommendations…hence why smaller positions as we figure out how the screener performs. These are longer term positions (months)…so I don’t want to be wicked out. Proceed at your own risk.  </p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>⬇️The 4 Stocks are: ⬇️</p>",
